    "details": {
      "alignment": "Neutral Good",
      "type": {
        "value": "humanoid",
        "subtype": "toad"
      },
      "cr": 0.25,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Liberated Toads cohort sheet — Barrel Survivor, Deck Voice.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-liberated-toads-actors.py</code> from the Pond Patrol docket (<code>data/liberatedToadsSystem.json</code>, snapshot Highsun 24, 1040 BF): level 3 on the docket → CR 1/4 as leader (inspiring commanders who strengthen allies through presence and tactics); no armour (AC 10), hit points 3d8 + 3. A GM-ready reading of the docket, not a filed stat line; the docket stays the authority.</p><p><strong>Barrel Survivors</strong> — The original 150 trafficked toads - the heart of the movement. Leader: Elder Mudcap. The traumatized survivors of the barrel trafficking operation. Many still bear psychological and physical scars. They are the reason the Liberated Toads exist.</p><p><strong>Stands in for</strong> 23 docket rows (levels 1, 2, 3): Block voice — mid decks, Assembly floor voice, Grievance speaker, Grievance line, Motion seconder, Vote line, Mid-deck voice, Lower hold voice, Family cluster head, Unaligned bunk elder, Elder Mudcap's aide. <strong>Named on the docket:</strong> Mudwhisper (Elder Mudcap's aide — <q>First to speak out about conditions</q>); Residen T (Block voice — mid decks — <q>Speaks for a corridor of bunks.</q>); Confiden T (Assembly floor voice — <q>Seconds motions that matter.</q>); Persisten T (Grievance line — <q>Will not leave until heard.</q>); Independen T (Unaligned bunk elder — <q>Votes with conscience, not cohort.</q>); Inhabitan T (Lower hold voice — <q>Knows every drip in the ceiling.</q>); Dependen T (Family cluster head — <q>Keeps three kids and one rumor mill fed.</q>). Rename the token for the toad at the table.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Specialisations</strong> — Testimony, Unity, Moral authority (the cohort feat)</li><li><strong>Leader</strong> — classDefinitions.leader: Commanding Presence (L1); Rally (L2); Tactical Direction (L3)</li><li><strong>Status</strong> — recovering: Many still traumatized; 3 confirmed deceased</li></ul>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
